program	export_duplicate_symbol_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	duplicate `@export` symbol `shared` (already exported by `a` at line 7)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: duplicate `@export` symbol `shared` (already exported by `a` at line 7)"
log	"  --> examples/export_duplicate_symbol_error.saw:10:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 10 | func b() -> Int { 2 }"
log	"     | ^"
log	"   hint: an unmangled C symbol must be unique across the program; give one an explicit `@export(\"other_name\")`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
